          <!-- Q3 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="body-md-strong text-ink font-semibold">3. What are Professional Courier charges per kg in India?</h3>
            <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Rates vary significantly depending on the transit route. Local deliveries within a state are cheaper (typically starting around ₹40-₹70 per kg), while long-distance national routes carry a higher per-kg rate.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Q4 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="body-md-strong text-ink font-semibold">4. Does Professional Courier charge based on volumetric weight?</h3>
            <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Yes. If a package is large but lightweight, the volumetric weight is calculated using the formula <code>(L × W × H) / 5000</code> in cm. If this value exceeds the physical weight, billing is based on volumetric weight.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Q5 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="body-md-strong text-ink font-semibold">5. How much does Professional Courier same-day delivery cost?</h3>
            <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
