            <h3 class="body-md-strong text-ink font-semibold">7. Does Professional Courier offer international shipping?</h3>
            <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Yes. Professional Courier provides international parcel services to major global locations. Rates depend on the target country, package parameters, and customs clearance requirements.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Q8 -->
