            <h3 class="body-md-strong text-ink font-semibold">8. Why is my actual Professional Courier price different from the estimate?</h3>
            <p class="body-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
              Differences occur due to minor scale differences, package size increases from volumetric bulges, fuel rate changes, out-of-delivery area (ODA) handling, or extra COD fees.
            </p>
